KIND       ID  FLAVOR          HANDLE           HOLDS               WHERE
runtime    0   current_thread  @0xADDR  1 task, 1 future    on 1 lwp
runtime    1   current_thread  @0xADDR  2 tasks, 2 futures  no thread inside it, found via a JoinHandle held by an enumerated task
local set  0                   @0xADDR  1 task, 1 future    on lwp 1150471, found via a task waker on a timer parked in a runtime's wheel
